EvoCore

This project is a modified and refactored autonomous research framework based
on EvoScientist (https://github.com/EvoScientist/EvoScientist).

Upstream attribution: Copyright 2026 EvoScientist.
The upstream Apache License, Version 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.

EvoCore changes include a separate research kernel, pluggable module contracts,
an external evidence and experiment harness, persistent literature and notes,
researcher/coder separation, observability and OpenHands coding integration.
This repository is maintained independently from the upstream project.

OpenHands and other external dependencies retain their own licenses. Installed
dependency environments and autonomous research run artifacts are not included
in this source distribution.
